From: Project Luma <luma@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Fix StButton pressed getter gesture target

st_button_get_pressed() incorrectly casts the StButton itself to a
ClutterPressGesture, producing critical warnings whenever mobile page
indicators query their pressed state. Read the button's click gesture, as the
property getter already does.
---
 src/st/st-button.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/st/st-button.c b/src/st/st-button.c
index 8a3b3d6..75aadfd 100644
--- a/src/st/st-button.c
+++ b/src/st/st-button.c
@@ -745,9 +745,12 @@ st_button_set_checked (StButton *button,
 gboolean
 st_button_get_pressed (StButton *button)
 {
+  StButtonPrivate *priv;
+
   g_return_val_if_fail (ST_IS_BUTTON (button), FALSE);
 
-  return clutter_press_gesture_get_pressed (CLUTTER_PRESS_GESTURE (button));
+  priv = st_button_get_instance_private (button);
+  return clutter_press_gesture_get_pressed (CLUTTER_PRESS_GESTURE (priv->click_gesture));
 }
 
 /**
